1
00:00:00,710 --> 00:00:04,800
It will shorten the war by five years
and save millions of lives.

2
00:00:07,383 --> 00:00:08,463
[CHATTERING AND CHEERING
ON TV]

3
00:00:08,676 --> 00:00:10,556
(Raj:)Pause it. That's it. Confirmed.

4
00:00:10,970 --> 00:00:14,310
(Raj:)We now have the address
of the Top Model house.

5
00:00:15,224 --> 00:00:18,394
(Howard:)God bless you,
Google Street View registered trademark.

6
00:00:20,646 --> 00:00:23,316
(Leonard:)Okay, for the record,
what you are doing is really creepy.

7
00:00:23,483 --> 00:00:28,323
If it's "creepy" to use the Internet,
military satellites and robot aircraft...

8
00:00:28,488 --> 00:00:30,818
(Howard:)...to find a house
full of gorgeous young models...

9
00:00:30,990 --> 00:00:35,330
(Howard:)...so that I can drop in on them
unexpectedly, then fine, I'm "creepy."

10
00:00:35,953 --> 00:00:37,873
[TELEPHONE RINGING]

11
00:00:40,541 --> 00:00:41,671
Hello?

12
00:00:41,834 --> 00:00:43,874
(Leonard(into phone, which has just rung):)Oh, hi.
Yeah, hold on a second, I'll get him.

13
00:00:44,045 --> 00:00:45,175
(Leonard(into phone, which has just rung):)Sheldon, it's for you.

14
00:00:45,338 --> 00:00:46,838
- Who is it?
- Your mother.

15
00:00:47,006 --> 00:00:49,006
(Penny:)Oh, good.

16
00:00:49,509 --> 00:00:52,139
(Sheldon:)Hi, Mom. How are you?

17
00:00:53,346 --> 00:00:55,516
(Sheldon:)But, Mom.

18
00:00:56,516 --> 00:01:00,026
(Sheldon:)She keeps sitting in my spot.

